SELECT MAX(RACES.YEAR) FROM RACES INNER JOIN CIRCUITS ON RACES.CIRCUITID = CIRCUITS.CIRCUITID WHERE CIRCUITS.NAME = 'BRANDS HATCH' AND RACES.NAME = 'BRITISH GRAND PRIX';
-- ----------sql2------------
-- 1
